*.spec

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- #
#                        Secrets & machine-local state                         #
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- #

# gitleaks guards the repo, but agents should never read these into context in
# the first place — anything loaded here can leak into a prompt or a report.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
.pypirc
.netrc
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
.streamlit/secrets.toml

